## Done criterion 2 — every weapon point, light and part name resolves

Cannot pass: there are no weapon points and no new lights, because the values for them are not in the
repository (see the blocker below). The part-name half *was* run against B-04's built module:

```
B-04 parts module: 59 parts, 59 distinct names
CPartProp objects: 6 resolve: 6 / 6
   part_index  0  sportsmuscle_body            resolves
   part_index 12  sportsmuscle_wheel_r_r       resolves
   part_index 11  sportsmuscle_wheel_r_l       resolves
   part_index 27  sportsmuscle_wheel_f_r       resolves
   part_index 26  sportsmuscle_wheel_f_l       resolves
   part_index  8  sportsmuscle_taillight_r_l   resolves
parts with no CPartProp: 53
